  "body": "<!-- cliproxyapi-linux-release-assets:start -->\n## Linux release assets\n\n- `CLIProxyAPI_<version>_linux_<arch>.tar.gz` is the default Linux build. It supports dynamic library plugins and is built against a GLIBC 2.17 baseline.\n- `CLIProxyAPI_<version>_linux_<arch>_no-plugin.tar.gz` is the portable Linux build for musl-based or older systems such as OpenWrt. It does not support dynamic library plugins.\n\n## FreeBSD release assets\n\n- `CLIProxyAPI_<version>_freebsd_aarch64_no-plugin.tar.gz` is the FreeBSD arm64 build. It is built without CGO and does not support dynamic library plugins.\n\n<!-- cliproxyapi-linux-release-assets:end -->\n\n## Changelog\n\n- perf(codex): avoid discarded copies of SSE data lines (cbf83183)\n- perf(codex): batch tool schema rewrites (56518489)\n- perf: index Responses tools and cache stream request validation (8a6a3968)\n- feat(models): add grok-4.7 model definition (130c8792)\n- chore(models): drop gpt-5.3-codex-spark from the embedded catalog (94b7cc2e)\n- style: gofmt codex bootstrap and cache-control tests (bf44a7f8)\n- fix(models): set grok-4.7 max completion to the context window (b9b50a83)\n- feat(executor): support execution-scoped request proxy overrides (d582067c)\n- Merge pull request #5680 from cookerpapa/perf/codex-tool-schema-batch (7f63f8c8)\n- Merge pull request #5990 from jack-5566/fix/responses-request-cache-pr (5083f650)\n- perf(executor): reuse identical Claude and Gemini request translations (639b7f11)\n- Merge pull request #5678 from cookerpapa/perf/codex-stream-copy (f6d582cb)\n- perf(executor): avoid discarded copies of Gemini and Kimi stream lines (a26cf2a8)\n- fix(gemini): preserve items for uppercase ARRAY type in schema sanitizer (2eb8dd11)\n\n\n## What's Changed\n* perf(codex): batch tool schema rewrites by @cookerpapa in https://github.com/router-for-me/CLIProxyAPI/pull/5680\n* perf: cache Responses request validation and index tool declarations by @jack-5566 in https://github.com/router-for-me/CLIProxyAPI/pull/5990\n* perf(codex): avoid discarded copies of SSE data lines by @cookerpapa in https://github.com/router-for-me/CLIProxyAPI/pull/5678\n\n## New Contributors\n* @jack-5566 made their first contribution in https://github.com/router-for-me/CLIProxyAPI/pull/5990\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/router-for-me/CLIProxyAPI/compare/v7.3.11...v7.3.12\n",
